flf2a$ 6 3 20 -1 8 0 128 153

Slanted FIGfont by Philippe Majerus (http://www.phm.lu/) (phm-slanted.flf).
This font includes the ISO 8859-1 and Windows 1252 Latin-1 character sets and a few extra.
This font uses Unicode 13.0 characters (sextants and smooth sextants).
It does not require an ANSI/VT terminal (does not use escape sequences) and works fine with FIGlet,
but the terminal must support the Unicode 13.0 Symbols for Legacy Computing block.
Date: September 25-29 and December 12, 2024, extras January 15, 2026

